#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:11
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "{2}\n"
#| "We've compiled some custom rules and best practices to enhance your gaming experience.\n"
#| "Keep in mind that these are just the \\textbf{opinions of the authors} of this book.\n"
#| "Enjoy!\n"
#| "\n"
msgid ""
"{2}\n"
"We've compiled some custom rules and best practices for fair competitive play.\n"
"They are intended for Clash Scenarios, where they reduce randomness and the luck factor.\n"
"Keep in mind that these are just the \\textbf{opinions of the authors} of this book.\n"
"Enjoy!\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"{2}\n"
"Dali jsme dohromady některá vlastní pravidla a osvědčené postupy, které zlepší váš herní zážitek.\n"
"Mějte na paměti, že se jedná pouze o \\textbf{názory autorů} této knihy.\n"
"Ať se líbí!\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Magic Arrows}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Magické Šípy}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Except for the Magic Arrow, each Spell appears exactly twice in the Spell Deck.\n"
"After players prepare their starting M\\&M Decks, it is recommended to remove Magic Arrows from the Spell Deck until no more than two remain.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Kromě Magického Šípu se každé Kouzlo v Balíčku Kouzel objevuje přesně dvakrát.\n"
"Po přípravě Úvodních M\\&M Balíčků všech hráčů se doporučuje odstranit Magické Šípy z Balíčku Kouzel, dokud nezůstanou více než dva.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Guaranteed Settlement}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Garantovaná Osada}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When distributing Far Tiles (II--III) between players, each player's pool of Map Tiles must include one Settlement.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Při rozdělování Vzdálených Dílků (II--III) mezi hráče musí každý hráč mít jeden dílek s Osadou.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Round One Mulligan}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Druhá Šance v Prvním Kole}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On your turn in the \\nth{1} Round, discard any number of Cards from your hand, then draw up to your draw limit as normal.\n"
"After that, you may shuffle your hand back into your Deck of Might and Magic, then draw up to your draw limit again.\n"
"You can use this Mulligan only once.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Unlike the Round One Mulligan in Tournament Mode, do not shuffle your Discard Pile back into your Deck.\n"
"The Cards you discarded stay out of your new hand.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Tier V--VII Combat on Hard$+$\\\\Difficulty}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Souboj Úrovně V--VII na Těžkou$+$\\\\Obtížnost}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:34
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "Treat Level V--VII Combats as one difficulty step lower when playing on Hard or Impossible.\n"
#| "For example, a Level VII Combat on Hard will be against 2 × \\svg{azure} Neutral Units.\n"
#| "\n"
msgid ""
"Treat Level V--VII Combats as one difficulty step lower when playing on Hard or Impossible.\n"
"For example, a Level VII Combat on Hard will be against 2 × \\svg{azure} Neutral Units.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Souboje úrovně V--VII budou mít o 1 nižší obtížnost při hře na Těžkou nebo Nemožnou obtížnost.\n"
"Například Souboj Úrovně VII na Těžkou obtížnost bude proti 2 × \\svg{azure} Neutrálním Jednotkám.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Trading Post}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Tržiště}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Although rules as written state that you can remove only one Card from your hand while Visiting a Trading Post, it is recommended to allow removing as many as you like.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"I když pravidla říkají, že při Navštívení Tržiště můžete odstranit pouze jednu Kartu z ruky, doporučuje se povolit odstranění libovolného počtu karet.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Victory Points}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Vítězné Body}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When playing with the optional Victory Points from the Tournament book, the following rules apply (unless overruled by the Scenario):\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Faction Towns grant 1 VP.\n"
"  \\item Possessing the Grail at the end of the match grants 3 VPs. If the Grail was transported to that player's Faction Town, it grants 5 VPs instead.\n"
"  \\item Capturing a Dragon Utopia grants 3 VPs.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Při hře s volitelnými Vítěznými Body (VB) z Knihy Turnajů platí následující pravidla (pokud nejsou nahrazena těmi ve scénáři):\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Frakční Města poskytují 1 VB.\n"
"  \\item Držení Grálu na konci hry poskytuje 3 VB. Pokud byl Grál přemístěn do Frakčního Města hráče, poskytuje 5 VB.\n"
"  \\item Obsazená Dračí Utopie poskytuje 3 VB.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Combat with Neutral Units}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Souboj s Neutrálními Jednotkami}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:51
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "During Combat with Neutral Units in clash Scenarios, if a player decides to deploy their Units only on one half (left or right) of the battle Board, the player positioning the Neutral Units must do the same.\n"
#| "\n"
msgid ""
"During Combat with Neutral Units in Clash Scenarios, if a player decides to deploy their Units only on one half (left or right) of the Combat Board, the player positioning the Neutral Units must do the same.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Pokud se během Souboje s Neutrálními Jednotkami ve Scénářích Střet hráč rozhodne umístit své Jednotky pouze na jednu polovinu (levou nebo pravou) Desky Bojiště, hráč umisťující Neutrální Jednotky musí udělat totéž.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:55
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "Placing Neutral Units far apart only makes the other player waste MPs, which slows the game down.\n"
#| "The exception to this rule is when there are three Neutral \\svg{unit_ground} or \\svg{unit_flying} Units to position, as all of them must go to the front line.\n"
#| "See examples that follow.\n"
#| "\n"
msgid ""
"Placing Neutral Units far apart only makes the other player waste \\svg{movement}, which slows the game down.\n"
"The exception to this rule is when there are three Neutral \\svg{unit_ground} or \\svg{unit_flying} Units to position, as all of them must go to the front line.\n"
"See examples that follow.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Umístění Neutrálních Jednotek daleko od sebe jen přinutí druhého hráče plýtvat BP, což zpomaluje hru.\n"
"Výjimkou z tohoto pravidla je, když je třeba umístit tři Neutrální \\svg{unit_ground} nebo \\svg{unit_flying} Jednotky, protože všechny musí jít do přední linie.\n"
"Viz následující příklady.\n"
"\n"

